-- check/bad: `n.modBy 2` on an `Int` is `name_removed` (checker-v2.md
-- §29.2), not "`Int` has no method called `modBy`": the message writes
-- `Int.mod n 2`, since `Int.mod` is a function of the `Int` module and the
-- type's methods stay `Basics`'s (§29.3), so there is no `n.mod 2`.
even : Int → Bool
even n = n.modBy 2 == 0
